heading out to their new spot with Rio texting a \"certain peach\" if she's interested in a double date for it. Outfit designs have ref sheet ready with inspiration behind them.\n\nRef Link: https://www.deviantart.com/stash/21bmy2dp7swr \nHas outfits refs + Pose ref", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/280c72a2/uploads/origins/640eb506-1a67-47bb-964b-8892632a2f22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16272ffdaddedd55c15ec5565489975c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/280c72a2/uploads/origins/640eb506-1a67-47bb-964b-8892632a2f22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16272ffdaddedd55c15ec5565489975c, https://si.imgix.net/280c72a2/uploads/origins/640eb506-1a67-47bb-964b-8892632a2f22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43d54fd129079f10ac035fa1ac56e32f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/280c72a2/uploads/origins/640eb506-1a67-47bb-964b-8892632a2f22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa61bf9fc2a279f31812ff123774173b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hey, this is me trying to figure out how this site works :D\n\nI would like to commission you to draw me a Glowwing Shipping (Ginga x Tyra) collage piece. Similar to the ShikiHei and Rune Factory pieces you've made recently.\n\nGlowwing Shipping dynamic is build on encouragement, affirmation, comfort and rest. With each other they can take rest from the pressure the world has put onto them. Often they relax together on a hill/patch of grass and gaze the stars together.\n\ntheir aesthetics are: Stars, feathers, asters and starglazer lilies.\n\ncharacter references:\nGinga - https://setteidreams.net/color-designs/beyblade/index.php?pic=006.png\nTyra = https://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/92253143_5JufnDoD8F3VBdR.png?1733397140\n!Tyra is a forehead shorter than Ginga!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b473d0ce/uploads/origins/3b41d972-9a5e-4c45-8c02-d8718759e666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a0c776c8869848013f2801b915e5b08", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b473d0ce/uploads/origins/3b41d972-9a5e-4c45-8c02-d8718759e666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a0c776c8869848013f2801b915e5b08, https://si.imgix.net/b473d0ce/uploads/origins/3b41d972-9a5e-4c45-8c02-d8718759e666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d832ea57b2cac5fafc0a4692de1b31a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b473d0ce/uploads/origins/3b41d972-9a5e-4c45-8c02-d8718759e666?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b098ef9052c03b0421caff4889cac27 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, SHOWGETSU先生!!\n\nI was so amazed by the drawing you made for me last time. Seriously, thank you!! It's still my wallpaper ^^\n\nThis time, I'd like to request an updated version of my OC with the character Arthur from Rune Factory 4.\n\nOriginal character: https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/1bwwrfr8ofe8ynwykliic/oc_refsheet_updated.jpg?rlkey=t5nfzlwtia5prim831qib1q6f&st=mgegk2pq&dl=0\n\nArthur: https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/tpk99mytdk1wb8qovjf64/Arthur_Art.png?rlkey=cf3bmwjb6q887jwjoyj4flu16&st=mq650z25&dl=0\n\nI hope it's possible. If there's any parts of the characters that you'd be more comfortable not drawing, please feel free to hide them in some way. I leave everything up to you. Please just make it cute and romantic! Thank you so much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3b3c892/uploads/origins/3c9f2f6b-2da1-42be-a962-a2ff78b1d131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6d299f607db30dfaef9dfa11bde8e45", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.i