he headpiece.\nMotifs: Arrows, maps, parchment, black horizon\n\n⭐ Character B. 172cm. She is a cute and cheerful elf girl who likes traveling and flying!\nPlease pay attention to her face markings and skin tone.\nMotifs: Stars, constellations, colorful birds, freedom\n\nThe two live in a fantasy world.\nChara A is helping Chara B. Chara B lost her memories. The two are friends.\n\nI would like art similar to these works:\nhttps://skeb.jp/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/18\nhttps://skeb.jp/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/19\n\nFor the rest of the composition, I will leave it to you! If there are any problems with the request, please decline. Thank you!\n\nLink of the reference pictures 👇\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/g55i53qxo2mzwp6/AACeggQlSEMUsaLxmIascnmYa?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/627a0375/uploads/origins/1601f7bd-ca9b-430d-ab90-4934832fa0c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8fc4b0c920bc1e17fa9a88381b3172ae", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/627a0375/uploads/origins/1601f7bd-ca9b-430d-ab90-4934832fa0c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8fc4b0c920bc1e17fa9a88381b3172ae, https://si.imgix.net/627a0375/uploads/origins/1601f7bd-ca9b-430d-ab90-4934832fa0c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0052e7b0e4634068c037b8083f8750ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/627a0375/uploads/origins/1601f7bd-ca9b-430d-ab90-4934832fa0c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bd0cd4ffaba52b4d6641b59b8524608 3x", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": false, "body": "I have the layout and script sketched out to make this easier for you.\nTwo people back from downpour. \nTowels on head and around shoulders.\nI will send the plan in direct messages (along with the character references)!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/21", "thumbnail_sr