129b3b/uploads/origins/5f7e3659-70b9-4919-842c-90b3f12f9f72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0ad724433be818411d11d78376e257a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6a129b3b/uploads/origins/5f7e3659-70b9-4919-842c-90b3f12f9f72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecfe8439d8f9acaf4f2dfcc4a46a53e7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!! It's me again, I adore your art and would be honored if you would be okay with me making a second request.\n\nThe request would be of my Lupin III OC, Suzume Yamashita. She is tough, smart, brave, headstrong, independent, fierce and mischievous. She is a police detecctive working for Interpol and she assists in helping Inspector Zenigata to capture the gentleman thief, Lupin III. I don't mind how you draw her, but just have fun!\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/dN1QwpMFNrsP8QN27\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/GM6AYJMt6bGCX5wF7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/87dd1858/uploads/origins/d66cc6f9-6555-4f41-accc-ea4481eea3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e32322e94599d033abda47c0e303b42a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87dd1858/uploads/origins/d66cc6f9-6555-4f41-accc-ea4481eea3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e32322e94599d033abda47c0e303b42a, https://si.imgix.net/87dd1858/uploads/origins/d66cc6f9-6555-4f41-accc-ea4481eea3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=406ed55593ae2ae88128f8839f270e16 2x, https://si.imgix.net/87dd1858/uploads/origins/d66cc6f9-6555-4f41-accc-ea4481eea3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c53f0803a870c7b6f814a49808263e4f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!! It's me again, I adore your art and would be honored if you would be okay with me making a second request.\n\nThe request would be of my character Einar. He is a distant, bitter, and vengeful. He is quiet, and keeps to himself. He is a vigilante who is working to bring down a criminal organization that his step-dad is a part of. I don't mind how you draw him, but just have fun!\n\nHe has lightening scars on one half of his body, and a tattoo on his arm. He also has a mole under his eye.\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/Kwy3Hh8tAC4vBpDo6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ITSASH0WTIME/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7bc185b0/uploads/origins/401a5ff8-4557-4d34-9d2d-dd2f81e4a8d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=965e932ceb56893b6d190bd49dd5a092", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7bc185b0/uploads/origins/401a5ff8-4557-4d34-9d2d-dd2f81e4a8d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=965e932ceb56893b6d190bd49dd5a092, https://si.imgix.net/7bc185b0/uploads/origins/401a5ff8-4557-4d34-9d2d-dd2f81e4a8d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d18abc0b52917f613a96ac9510384da 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7bc185b0/uploads/origins/401a5ff8-4557-4d34-9d2d-dd2f81e4a8d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9e1a3e624f4cbfee3ea70b0e7323ada 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I adore your artstyle— it’s so cool and clean~♡\n\n▼ About the Request\nI would like to request art of my Vtuber, Inklypuff, in your style. ☺️ She is a mischievous Digital Girl who lives in your Wi-Fi! \n\nHer design reference is in the attached drive link.\n\nPose, bg, & expression I leave to you, I just hope that you have lots of fun drawing her character design & the cyber / tech theme!\n\n▼ About usage & special requests\nI would like to request permission to use the art on various social medias for posts, headers and icons; promotional graphics (like schedule posts or a stream event); video thumbnails / assets,